<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Battlefields</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Six months have passed since end of the war, and Adora and Catra struggle to navigate their new lives as a couple. Fractures appear in their relationship as Adora's new responsibilities as She-Ra drive a wedge between them. After a harsh argument while visiting Bright Moon Castle they become determined to mend their problems, leading them to discover new perspectives on love and commitment from their friends.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A cosy story of five couples, each with their own struggles and philosophies on love, framed around Catra and Adora's efforts to overcome their own emotional turmoil. Includes some soft angst/drama. Cautiously rated soft M for sexual insinuations.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>backintimePBA</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
